Package: usb-cctv-recorder
Version: {version}
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: USB CCTV Recorder contributors
Depends: {shlibs_depends}, ffmpeg, pulseaudio-utils, v4l-utils, systemd
Description: Local USB camera and microphone recorder for KDE
 USB CCTV Recorder is a local, evidence-conscious recorder for one USB camera
 and microphone. It includes its Python and PySide runtime in a PyInstaller
 one-folder bundle and uses the logged-in user's on-demand systemd worker.
